{"ok": true, "summary": "识别为电子膨胀阀阀体组件，含主视图、俯视图，单位毫米。读得阀体Ø32×60、上段Ø28×35、两接管外径Ø9.52，侧伸40、下伸35，侧管轴高22，内孔Ø14、节流孔Ø1.6。按轴对称主体加侧管重建；顶凸台估Ø20×6、管壁假设0.8，内部连通及材料分界待确认。图中俯视中心圆与主视顶部不一致，暂以主视外形为准；质量仅为假设结构估算。", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>电子膨胀阀阀体组件 · 图纸重建</title>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;overflow:hidden;height:100%;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\ncanvas{display:block}\n#panel{position:absolute;left:12px;top:12px;max-width:300px;padding:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;color:#30343b}\n#panel h3{font-size:14px;margin:0 0 5px}\n.legend{display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:2px;margin-right:5px}\nbutton{background:white;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;cursor:pointer;font:12px \"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\nbutton:hover{border-color:#b11f4b}\n#buttons{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:8px}\n#error{display:none;position:absolute;top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);color:#b00020;background:white;padding:18px;max-width:80%}\n#hint{position:absolute;right:12px;bottom:12px;color:#656565;font-size:12px;pointer-events:none}\n</style>\n<script type=\"importmap\">{\"imports\":{\"three\":\"/static/vendor/three/three.module.js\",\"three/addons/\":\"/static/vendor/three/jsm/\"}}</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"panel\">\n<h3>电子膨胀阀阀体组件 · 示意重建</h3>\n<div>视图：主视＋俯视；单位 mm</div>\n<div>标注：阀体 Ø32×60；上段 Ø28×35</div>\n<div>标注：管 Ø9.52；侧伸40 / 下伸35</div>\n<div>标注：侧轴高22；内孔Ø14 / 节流Ø1.6</div>\n<div>假设：顶台Ø20×6；壁0.8；盲孔深52</div>\n<div id=\"estimate\"></div>\n<div><i class=\"legend\" style=\"background:#c9a227\"></i>H62黄铜阀体 <i class=\"legend\" style=\"background:#b87333\"></i>TP2紫铜接管</div>\n<div><i class=\"legend\" style=\"background:#2b2b2b\"></i>PA66线圈座（分界假设）</div>\n<div><i class=\"legend\" style=\"background:#3b82f6\"></i>假设流腔；剖切无填面，非制造依据</div>\n<div id=\"buttons\"><button id=\"cut\">剖切视图</button><button id=\"explode\">爆炸视图</button><button id=\"rotate\">自动旋转</button></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"error\"></div>\n<div id=\"hint\">拖动旋转 · 滚轮缩放 · 右键平移</div>\n<script type=\"module\">\nimport * as THREE from 'three';\nimport { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';\nimport { RoomEnvironment } from 'three/addons/environments/RoomEnvironment.js';\nconst P = {\n  // 图中明确标注，尺寸单位 mm；主体底面为 y=0\n  bodyD:32, bodyH:60, upperD:28, upperH:35,\n  pipeD:9.52, sideL:40, bottomL:35, sideY:22,\n  boreD:14, orificeD:1.6,\n  // 以下为假设，内孔由顶部向下至 y=4，顶部保留4 mm实体\n  capD:20, capH:6, wall:0.8, boreBottom:4, boreTop:56,\n  // 材质分界假设：上段与顶台均为PA66；未建阀针和线圈\n  brassDensity:8.50, copperDensity:8.96, plasticDensity:1.40,\n  metalness:0.85, roughness:0.35, plasticRoughness:0.6,\n  fluidOpacity:0.55, segments:64,\n  brassColor:'#c9a227', copperColor:'#b87333',\n  plasticColor:'#2b2b2b', fluidColor:'#3b82f6',\n  upperExplode:20, sideExplode:18, bottomExplode:18\n};\nfunction showError(message){\n  const element=document.getElementById('error');\n  element.style.display='block';\n  element.textContent='模型加载失败：'+message;\n}\nwindow.addEventListener('error',e=>showError(e.message));\ntry {\n  const renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true,preserveDrawingBuffer:true});\n  renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,2));\n  renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);\n  renderer.localClippingEnabled=true;\n  renderer.outputColorSpace=THREE.SRGBColorSpace;\n  document.body.prepend(renderer.domElement);\n  const scene=new THREE.Scene();\n  scene.background=new THREE.Color('#f7f4ef');\n  scene.environment=new THREE.PMREMGenerator(renderer).fromScene(new RoomEnvironment(),0.04).texture;\n  scene.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xffffff,0x8d8d8d,0.6));\n  const light=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff,1.2);\n  light.position.set(100,180,130);\n  scene.add(light);\n  const camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(40,innerWidth/innerHeight,1,20000);\n  const controls=new OrbitControls(camera,renderer.domElement);\n  controls.enableDamping=true;\n  controls.autoRotate=true;\n  controls.autoRotateSpeed=1.0;\n  controls.addEventListener('start',()=>{controls.autoRotate=false;updateRotate();});\n  const modelGroup=new THREE.Group();\n  scene.add(modelGroup);\n  const metal=color=>new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\n    color,metalness:P.metalness,roughness:P.roughness,side:THREE.DoubleSide\n  });\n  const brass=metal(P.brassColor), copper=metal(P.copperColor);\n  const plastic=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\n    color:P.plasticColor,metalness:0,roughness:P.plasticRoughness,side:THREE.DoubleSide\n  });\n  const fluid=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\n    color:P.fluidColor,metalness:0,roughness:0.3,transparent:true,\n    opacity:P.fluidOpacity,depthWrite:false,side:THREE.DoubleSide\n  });\n  const bodyGroup=new THREE.Group(),upperGroup=new THREE.Group();\n  const sideGroup=new THREE.Group(),bottomGroup=new THREE.Group(),flowGroup=new THREE.Group();\n  modelGroup.add(bodyGroup,upperGroup,sideGroup,bottomGroup,flowGroup);\n  function cylinder(radius,height,material,parent,x,y,z,side=false){\n    const mesh=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(radius,radius,height,P.segments),material);\n    if(side) mesh.rotation.z=-Math.PI/2;\n    mesh.position.set(x,y,z);\n    parent.add(mesh);\n    return mesh;\n  }\n  function lathe(points,material,parent){\n    const geometry=new THREE.LatheGeometry(points.map(p=>new THREE.Vector2(...p)),P.segments);\n    const mesh=new THREE.Mesh(geometry,material);\n    parent.add(mesh);\n    return mesh;\n  }\n  const radius=P.bodyD/2,bore=P.boreD/2,throat=P.orificeD/2;\n  // 旋转截面形成真实轴向盲腔及节流孔；侧向孔以蓝色示意\n  lathe([[throat,0],[radius,0],[radius,P.bodyH],[0,P.bodyH],\n    [0,P.boreTop],[bore,P.boreTop],[bore,P.boreBottom],\n    [throat,P.boreBottom],[throat,0]],brass,bodyGroup);\n  cylinder(P.upperD/2,P.upperH,plastic,upperGroup,0,P.bodyH+P.upperH/2,0);\n  cylinder(P.capD/2,P.capH,plastic,upperGroup,0,P.bodyH+P.upperH+P.capH/2,0);\n  const outer=P.pipeD/2,inner=outer-P.wall;\n  function pipe(length,parent){\n    return lathe([[inner,0],[outer,0],[outer,length],[inner,length],[inner,0]],copper,parent);\n  }\n  const sidePipe=pipe(P.sideL,sideGroup);\n  sidePipe.rotation.z=-Math.PI/2;\n  sideGroup.position.set(radius,P.sideY,0);\n  pipe(P.bottomL,bottomGroup);\n  bottomGroup.position.y=-P.bottomL;\n  cylinder(bore,P.boreTop-P.boreBottom,fluid,flowGroup,0,(P.boreTop+P.boreBottom)/2,0);\n  cylinder(throat,P.boreBottom,fluid,flowGroup,0,P.boreBottom/2,0);\n  cylinder(inner,P.bottomL,fluid,bottomGroup,0,P.bottomL/2,0);\n  cylinder(inner,P.sideL,fluid,sideGroup,P.sideL/2,0,0,true);\n  cylinder(inner,radius-bore,fluid,flowGroup,(radius+bore)/2,P.sideY,0,true);\n  const ringArea=Math.PI*(outer*outer-inner*inner);\n  const brassVolume=Math.PI*radius*radius*P.bodyH-\n    Math.PI*bore*bore*(P.boreTop-P.boreBottom)-Math.PI*throat*throat*P.boreBottom;\n  const copperVolume=ringArea*(P.sideL+P.bottomL);\n  const plasticVolume=Math.PI/4*(P.upperD**2*P.upperH+P.capD**2*P.capH);\n  const brassMass=brassVolume*P.brassDensity/1e6;\n  const copperMass=copperVolume*P.copperDensity/1e6;\n  const plasticMass=plasticVolume*P.plasticDensity/1e6;\n  document.getElementById('estimate').textContent=\n    `估算质量 ${(brassMass+copperMass+plasticMass).toFixed(3)} kg；侧孔未扣料`;\n  const box=new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(modelGroup,true);\n  const size=box.getSize(new THREE.Vector3()),center=box.getCenter(new THREE.Vector3());\n  const grid=new THREE.GridHelper(240,12,0xd8d4ce,0xe7e3dc);\n  grid.position.y=box.min.y-0.5;\n  scene.add(grid);\n  function fit(){\n    const halfFov=THREE.MathUtils.degToRad(camera.fov/2);\n    const angle=Math.min(halfFov,Math.atan(Math.tan(halfFov)*camera.aspect));\n    const distance=size.length()/2/Math.sin(angle)/0.70;\n    camera.position.copy(center).add(new THREE.Vector3(1,0.7,1.2).normalize().multiplyScalar(distance));\n    controls.target.copy(center);\n    controls.update();\n  }\n  fit();\n  const plane=new THREE.Plane(new THREE.Vector3(0,0,-1),0);\n  let cut=false,exploded=false;\n  const materials=[brass,copper,plastic,fluid];\n  document.getElementById('cut').onclick=()=>{\n    cut=!cut;\n    materials.forEach(material=>{material.clippingPlanes=cut?[plane]:[];material.needsUpdate=true;});\n    document.getElementById('cut').textContent=cut?'完整视图':'剖切视图';\n  };\n  document.getElementById('explode').onclick=()=>{\n    exploded=!exploded;\n    upperGroup.position.y=exploded?P.upperExplode:0;\n    sideGroup.position.x=radius+(exploded?P.sideExplode:0);\n    bottomGroup.position.y=-P.bottomL-(exploded?P.bottomExplode:0);\n    document.getElementById('explode').textContent=exploded?'装配视图':'爆炸视图';\n  };\n  function updateRotate(){\n    document.getElementById('rotate').style.color=controls.autoRotate?'#b11f4b':'#30343b';\n    document.getElementById('rotate').setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(controls.autoRotate));\n  }\n  document.getElementById('rotate').onclick=()=>{controls.autoRotate=!controls.autoRotate;updateRotate();};\n  updateRotate();\n  window.addEventListener('resize',()=>{\n    camera.aspect=innerWidth/innerHeight;\n    camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n    renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);\n  });\n  window.__scene=scene;window.__camera=camera;window.__renderer=renderer;\n  window.__controls=controls;window.__model=modelGroup;\n  renderer.setAnimationLoop(()=>{controls.update();renderer.render(scene,camera);});\n} catch(error) {\n  showError(error.message);\n}\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>", "metrics": [{"label": "装配外形包络", "value": "72 × 136 × 32", "unit": "mm", "note": "含假设顶凸台；宽×高×深"}, {"label": "H62阀体质量", "value": "0.3421", "unit": "kg", "note": "密度8.50；扣轴孔，未扣示意侧孔"}, {"label": "TP2接管质量", "value": "0.0147", "unit": "kg", "note": "密度8.96；假设壁厚0.8，无插入段"}, {"label": "PA66线圈座质量", "value": "0.0328", "unit": "kg", "note": "密度1.40；上段及顶台按实心估算"}, {"label": "组件合计质量", "value": "0.3896", "unit": "kg", "note": "不含阀针、线圈、密封及连接材料"}, {"label": "两接管总长度", "value": "75", "unit": "mm", "note": "侧管40＋下管35；不含内部示意通道"}], "suggestions": ["把接管壁厚改为1毫米并对比质量", "增加阀针与节流孔局部剖视", "按补充剖视图修正内部孔道和材料分界"], "raw": "<<<SUMMARY>>>\n识别为电子膨胀阀阀体组件，含主视图、俯视图，单位毫米。读得阀体Ø32×60、上段Ø28×35、两接管外径Ø9.52，侧伸40、下伸35，侧管轴高22，内孔Ø14、节流孔Ø1.6。按轴对称主体加侧管重建；顶凸台估Ø20×6、管壁假设0.8，内部连通及材料分界待确认。图中俯视中心圆与主视顶部不一致，暂以主视外形为准；质量仅为假设结构估算。\n<<<HTML>>>\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>电子膨胀阀阀体组件 · 图纸重建</title>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;overflow:hidden;height:100%;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\ncanvas{display:block}\n#panel{position:absolute;left:12px;top:12px;max-width:300px;padding:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;color:#30343b}\n#panel h3{font-size:14px;margin:0 0 5px}\n.legend{display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:2px;margin-right:5px}\nbutton{background:white;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;cursor:pointer;font:12px \"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\nbutton:hover{border-color:#b11f4b}\n#buttons{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:8px}\n#error{display:none;position:absolute;top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);color:#b00020;background:white;padding:18px;max-width:80%}\n#hint{position:absolute;right:12px;bottom:12px;color:#656565;font-size:12px;pointer-events:none}\n</style>\n<script type=\"importmap\">{\"imports\":{\"three\":\"/static/vendor/three/three.module.js\",\"three/addons/\":\"/static/vendor/three/jsm/\"}}</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"panel\">\n<h3>电子膨胀阀阀体组件 · 示意重建</h3>\n<div>视图：主视＋俯视；单位 mm</div>\n<div>标注：阀体 Ø32×60；上段 Ø28×35</div>\n<div>标注：管 Ø9.52；侧伸40 / 下伸35</div>\n<div>标注：侧轴高22；内孔Ø14 / 节流Ø1.6</div>\n<div>假设：顶台Ø20×6；壁0.8；盲孔深52</div>\n<div id=\"estimate\"></div>\n<div><i class=\"legend\" style=\"background:#c9a227\"></i>H62黄铜阀体 <i class=\"legend\" style=\"background:#b87333\"></i>TP2紫铜接管</div>\n<div><i class=\"legend\" style=\"background:#2b2b2b\"></i>PA66线圈座（分界假设）</div>\n<div><i class=\"legend\" style=\"background:#3b82f6\"></i>假设流腔；剖切无填面，非制造依据</div>\n<div id=\"buttons\"><button id=\"cut\">剖切视图</button><button id=\"explode\">爆炸视图</button><button id=\"rotate\">自动旋转</button></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"error\"></div>\n<div id=\"hint\">拖动旋转 · 滚轮缩放 · 右键平移</div>\n<script type=\"module\">\nimport * as THREE from 'three';\nimport { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';\nimport { RoomEnvironment } from 'three/addons/environments/RoomEnvironment.js';\nconst P = {\n  // 图中明确标注，尺寸单位 mm；主体底面为 y=0\n  bodyD:32, bodyH:60, upperD:28, upperH:35,\n  pipeD:9.52, sideL:40, bottomL:35, sideY:22,\n  boreD:14, orificeD:1.6,\n  // 以下为假设，内孔由顶部向下至 y=4，顶部保留4 mm实体\n  capD:20, capH:6, wall:0.8, boreBottom:4, boreTop:56,\n  // 材质分界假设：上段与顶台均为PA66；未建阀针和线圈\n  brassDensity:8.50, copperDensity:8.96, plasticDensity:1.40,\n  metalness:0.85, roughness:0.35, plasticRoughness:0.6,\n  fluidOpacity:0.55, segments:64,\n  brassColor:'#c9a227', copperColor:'#b87333',\n  plasticColor:'#2b2b2b', fluidColor:'#3b82f6',\n  upperExplode:20, sideExplode:18, bottomExplode:18\n};\nfunction showError(message){\n  const element=document.getElementById('error');\n  element.style.display='block';\n  element.textContent='模型加载失败：'+message;\n}\nwindow.addEventListener('error',e=>showError(e.message));\ntry {\n  const renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true,preserveDrawingBuffer:true});\n  renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,2));\n  renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);\n  renderer.localClippingEnabled=true;\n  renderer.outputColorSpace=THREE.SRGBColorSpace;\n  document.body.prepend(renderer.domElement);\n  const scene=new THREE.Scene();\n  scene.background=new THREE.Color('#f7f4ef');\n  scene.environment=new THREE.PMREMGenerator(renderer).fromScene(new RoomEnvironment(),0.04).texture;\n  scene.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xffffff,0x8d8d8d,0.6));\n  const light=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff,1.2);\n  light.position.set(100,180,130);\n  scene.add(light);\n  const camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(40,innerWidth/innerHeight,1,20000);\n  const controls=new OrbitControls(camera,renderer.domElement);\n  controls.enableDamping=true;\n  controls.autoRotate=true;\n  controls.autoRotateSpeed=1.0;\n  controls.addEventListener('start',()=>{controls.autoRotate=false;updateRotate();});\n  const modelGroup=new THREE.Group();\n  scene.add(modelGroup);\n  const metal=color=>new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\n    color,metalness:P.metalness,roughness:P.roughness,side:THREE.DoubleSide\n  });\n  const brass=metal(P.brassColor), copper=metal(P.copperColor);\n  const plastic=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\n    color:P.plasticColor,metalness:0,roughness:P.plasticRoughness,side:THREE.DoubleSide\n  });\n  const fluid=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\n    color:P.fluidColor,metalness:0,roughness:0.3,transparent:true,\n    opacity:P.fluidOpacity,depthWrite:false,side:THREE.DoubleSide\n  });\n  const bodyGroup=new THREE.Group(),upperGroup=new THREE.Group();\n  const sideGroup=new THREE.Group(),bottomGroup=new THREE.Group(),flowGroup=new THREE.Group();\n  modelGroup.add(bodyGroup,upperGroup,sideGroup,bottomGroup,flowGroup);\n  function cylinder(radius,height,material,parent,x,y,z,side=false){\n    const mesh=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(radius,radius,height,P.segments),material);\n    if(side) mesh.rotation.z=-Math.PI/2;\n    mesh.position.set(x,y,z);\n    parent.add(mesh);\n    return mesh;\n  }\n  function lathe(points,material,parent){\n    const geometry=new THREE.LatheGeometry(points.map(p=>new THREE.Vector2(...p)),P.segments);\n    const mesh=new THREE.Mesh(geometry,material);\n    parent.add(mesh);\n    return mesh;\n  }\n  const radius=P.bodyD/2,bore=P.boreD/2,throat=P.orificeD/2;\n  // 旋转截面形成真实轴向盲腔及节流孔；侧向孔以蓝色示意\n  lathe([[throat,0],[radius,0],[radius,P.bodyH],[0,P.bodyH],\n    [0,P.boreTop],[bore,P.boreTop],[bore,P.boreBottom],\n    [throat,P.boreBottom],[throat,0]],brass,bodyGroup);\n  cylinder(P.upperD/2,P.upperH,plastic,upperGroup,0,P.bodyH+P.upperH/2,0);\n  cylinder(P.capD/2,P.capH,plastic,upperGroup,0,P.bodyH+P.upperH+P.capH/2,0);\n  const outer=P.pipeD/2,inner=outer-P.wall;\n  function pipe(length,parent){\n    return lathe([[inner,0],[outer,0],[outer,length],[inner,length],[inner,0]],copper,parent);\n  }\n  const sidePipe=pipe(P.sideL,sideGroup);\n  sidePipe.rotation.z=-Math.PI/2;\n  sideGroup.position.set(radius,P.sideY,0);\n  pipe(P.bottomL,bottomGroup);\n  bottomGroup.position.y=-P.bottomL;\n  cylinder(bore,P.boreTop-P.boreBottom,fluid,flowGroup,0,(P.boreTop+P.boreBottom)/2,0);\n  cylinder(throat,P.boreBottom,fluid,flowGroup,0,P.boreBottom/2,0);\n  cylinder(inner,P.bottomL,fluid,bottomGroup,0,P.bottomL/2,0);\n  cylinder(inner,P.sideL,fluid,sideGroup,P.sideL/2,0,0,true);\n  cylinder(inner,radius-bore,fluid,flowGroup,(radius+bore)/2,P.sideY,0,true);\n  const ringArea=Math.PI*(outer*outer-inner*inner);\n  const brassVolume=Math.PI*radius*radius*P.bodyH-\n    Math.PI*bore*bore*(P.boreTop-P.boreBottom)-Math.PI*throat*throat*P.boreBottom;\n  const copperVolume=ringArea*(P.sideL+P.bottomL);\n  const plasticVolume=Math.PI/4*(P.upperD**2*P.upperH+P.capD**2*P.capH);\n  const brassMass=brassVolume*P.brassDensity/1e6;\n  const copperMass=copperVolume*P.copperDensity/1e6;\n  const plasticMass=plasticVolume*P.plasticDensity/1e6;\n  document.getElementById('estimate').textContent=\n    `估算质量 ${(brassMass+copperMass+plasticMass).toFixed(3)} kg；侧孔未扣料`;\n  const box=new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(modelGroup,true);\n  const size=box.getSize(new THREE.Vector3()),center=box.getCenter(new THREE.Vector3());\n  const grid=new THREE.GridHelper(240,12,0xd8d4ce,0xe7e3dc);\n  grid.position.y=box.min.y-0.5;\n  scene.add(grid);\n  function fit(){\n    const halfFov=THREE.MathUtils.degToRad(camera.fov/2);\n    const angle=Math.min(halfFov,Math.atan(Math.tan(halfFov)*camera.aspect));\n    const distance=size.length()/2/Math.sin(angle)/0.70;\n    camera.position.copy(center).add(new THREE.Vector3(1,0.7,1.2).normalize().multiplyScalar(distance));\n    controls.target.copy(center);\n    controls.update();\n  }\n  fit();\n  const plane=new THREE.Plane(new THREE.Vector3(0,0,-1),0);\n  let cut=false,exploded=false;\n  const materials=[brass,copper,plastic,fluid];\n  document.getElementById('cut').onclick=()=>{\n    cut=!cut;\n    materials.forEach(material=>{material.clippingPlanes=cut?[plane]:[];material.needsUpdate=true;});\n    document.getElementById('cut').textContent=cut?'完整视图':'剖切视图';\n  };\n  document.getElementById('explode').onclick=()=>{\n    exploded=!exploded;\n    upperGroup.position.y=exploded?P.upperExplode:0;\n    sideGroup.position.x=radius+(exploded?P.sideExplode:0);\n    bottomGroup.position.y=-P.bottomL-(exploded?P.bottomExplode:0);\n    document.getElementById('explode').textContent=exploded?'装配视图':'爆炸视图';\n  };\n  function updateRotate(){\n    document.getElementById('rotate').style.color=controls.autoRotate?'#b11f4b':'#30343b';\n    document.getElementById('rotate').setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(controls.autoRotate));\n  }\n  document.getElementById('rotate').onclick=()=>{controls.autoRotate=!controls.autoRotate;updateRotate();};\n  updateRotate();\n  window.addEventListener('resize',()=>{\n    camera.aspect=innerWidth/innerHeight;\n    camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n    renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);\n  });\n  window.__scene=scene;window.__camera=camera;window.__renderer=renderer;\n  window.__controls=controls;window.__model=modelGroup;\n  renderer.setAnimationLoop(()=>{controls.update();renderer.render(scene,camera);});\n} catch(error) {\n  showError(error.message);\n}\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n<<<METRICS>>>\n[\n  {\"label\":\"装配外形包络\",\"value\":\"72 × 136 × 32\",\"unit\":\"mm\",\"note\":\"含假设顶凸台；宽×高×深\"},\n  {\"label\":\"H62阀体质量\",\"value\":\"0.3421\",\"unit\":\"kg\",\"note\":\"密度8.50；